{"about":["The prophesied end of the Zemurian continent draws near, and so does the launch of humanity's first foray into space. A sudden invitation from Marduk to cooperate in a high-tech training exercise sets Van Arkride, Ashen Chevalier Rean Schwarzer, and Father Kevin Graham on a collision course with the secrets at the very core of Zemuria.","Their paths may diverge, but the ultimate question remains the same: Just what lies beyond the edge of the horizon?"],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/7153a74ff3d908ca61eb5f1776be2a5792d86a3aa72f0551.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/7153a74ff3d908ca61eb5f1776be2a5792d86a3aa72f0551.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/64d9af2fe233eb4b40324a13bba70d4849f25917dc12c124.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/64d9af2fe233eb4b40324a13bba70d4849f25917dc12c124.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/1a0a3ffdd6bf813d274217bdaf64fe3c0c65a0d8951d3071.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/1a0a3ffdd6bf813d274217bdaf64fe3c0c65a0d8951d3071.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/f487cca8a24361a1e34313125de61b37c76322da6a57d5ba.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/f487cca8a24361a1e34313125de61b37c76322da6a57d5ba.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/9bbbc00a69ea8d4954271ae55af3091f8ae5b92bf95307f1.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/9bbbc00a69ea8d4954271ae55af3091f8ae5b92bf95307f1.jpg?w=256&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202511/2120/d5704343b8ebfe4c87acff195ea9fdf0b8f3773